+		CW(0x84Fu, 0x0u);                  /* CP_PROTECT_CNTL: DISABLED. We enabled fault-on-unlisted (0x3) but never programmed the protect table (0x850-0x87F), so the first freedreno IB that writes a register wedges the CP (protstat hang). HackiOS leaves protection off during bring-up -> match it. */
