+ * (and every non-GPU) PAS init_image MAPS the NS metadata buffer into TZ to read it and checks the
+ * buffer PA is inside a DDR bank XBL registered with TZ at boot (table populated once at TZ boot; no
+ * runtime SMC adds to it). Our gmub_alloc_phys buffer sits in XNU's high RAM (~0xb7xxxxxx), which is
